msgstr "Saya adalah asisten manajemen cerdas untuk sistem AoT."

#: ai/ai_routing_service.py:162
msgid ""
"AoT (AI of Things) is an AI-based spatial control and monitoring system."
msgstr ""
"AoT (AI of Things) adalah sistem kontrol dan pemantauan ruang berbasis AI."

#: ai/ai_routing_service.py:171
msgid "I currently support Korean, English, Japanese, and more."
msgstr "Saat ini saya mendukung bahasa Korea, Inggris, Jepang, dan lainnya."

#: ai/ai_routing_service.py:342 ai/ai_routing_service.py:354
#: ai/ai_routing_service.py:517
msgid "Service is temporarily unavailable. Please try again."
msgstr "Layanan sedang tidak tersedia sementara. Silakan coba lagi."

#: ai/ai_routing_service.py:448 ai/services/ai_agent_service.py:1037
msgid "I'm not sure I understood your request. Could you please clarify?"
msgstr ""
"Saya kurang yakin memahami permintaan Anda. Bisakah Anda memperjelasnya?"

#: ai/agents/ai_router.py:15
msgid ""
"Gatekeeper agent that classifies user intent into 5 categories (Control, "
"Data Query, Schedule, Composite, Chat) for v6 pipeline routing."
msgstr ""
"Agen gatekeeper yang mengklasifikasikan maksud pengguna ke dalam 5 kategori "
"(Kontrol, Kueri Data, Penjadwalan, Gabungan, Obrolan) untuk perutean "
"pipeline v6."

#: ai/agents/anthropic.py:29
msgid ""
"Anthropic's Claude engine, known for human-like reasoning, sophisticated "
"analysis, and safe response generation."
msgstr ""
"Mesin Claude dari Anthropic, dikenal karena penalaran yang menyerupai "
"manusia, analisis yang canggih, dan penghasilan respons yang aman."

#: ai/agents/gemini.py:29
msgid ""
"Google's state-of-the-art multimodal AI engine, capable of understanding and"
" generating text, code, and images with a massive context window."
msgstr ""
"Mesin AI multimodal mutakhir dari Google, mampu memahami dan menghasilkan "
"teks, kode, dan gambar dengan jendela konteks yang sangat besar."

#: ai/agents/groq.py:26
msgid ""
"Provides extremely fast inference speeds using Groq's LPU (Language "
"Processing Unit) technology, supporting models like Llama 3.3 and GPT-OSS."
msgstr ""
"Memberikan kecepatan inferensi yang sangat cepat menggunakan teknologi LPU "
"(Language Processing Unit) dari Groq, mendukung model seperti Llama 3.3 dan "
"GPT-OSS."

#: ai/agents/mcp_aot.py:15
msgid ""
"AoT System Specialist. Queries sensor history, spatial hierarchy, device "
"search, and energy reports via internal system tools."
msgstr ""
"Spesialis Sistem AoT. Mengambil riwayat sensor, hierarki spasial, pencarian "
"perangkat, dan laporan energi melalui alat sistem internal."

#: ai/agents/mcp_database.py:8
msgid ""
"Analyzes data by querying PostgreSQL/SQLite databases using natural "
"language."
msgstr ""
"Menganalisis data dengan melakukan kueri pada database PostgreSQL/SQLite "
"menggunakan bahasa alami."

#: ai/agents/mcp_excel.py:8
msgid ""
"Generates professional environmental reports in Excel based on analyzed "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Menghasilkan laporan lingkungan profesional dalam format Excel berdasarkan "
"data yang dianalisis."

#: ai/agents/mcp_fetch.py:8
msgid ""
"Collects real-time information by directly reading or exploring web page "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Mengumpulkan informasi real-time dengan membaca atau menjelajahi konten "
"halaman web secara langsung."

#: ai/agents/mcp_google_maps.py:10
msgid ""
"Provides location-based information and geographical analysis using Google "
"Maps data."
msgstr ""
"Menyediakan informasi berbasis lokasi dan analisis geografis menggunakan "
"data Google Maps."

#: ai/agents/mcp_grafana.py:10
msgid ""
"Provides visual insights by analyzing Grafana dashboards and data, reporting"
" on detected anomalies."
msgstr ""
"Memberikan wawasan visual dengan menganalisis dashboard dan data Grafana, "
"serta melaporkan anomali yang terdeteksi."

#: ai/agents/mcp_influxdb.py:9
msgid "Analyzes InfluxDB v2 time-series data and performs Flux queries."
msgstr "Menganalisis data deret waktu InfluxDB v2 dan menjalankan kueri Flux."

#: ai/agents/mcp_iotdb.py:10
msgid ""
"Performs precise analysis of large-scale time-series sensor data stored in "
"Apache IoTDB."
msgstr ""
"Melakukan analisis presisi terhadap data sensor deret waktu skala besar yang"
" tersimpan di Apache IoTDB."

#: ai/agents/minimax.py:26
msgid ""
"MiniMax M2 series MoE models — optimized for coding, agentic workflows, and "
"multilingual tasks. OpenAI-compatible API."
msgstr ""
"Model MoE seri MiniMax M2 — dioptimalkan untuk pemrograman, alur kerja "
"agentic, dan tugas multibahasa. Menyediakan API yang kompatibel dengan "
"OpenAI."

#: ai/agents/mistral.py:24
msgid ""
"Mistral engine, a powerful open/closed-source model developed in Europe, "
"boasting multilingual capabilities and exceptional efficiency."
msgstr ""
"Mesin Mistral, model open/closed-source yang kuat dan dikembangkan di Eropa,"
" unggul dalam kemampuan multibahasa dan efisiensi luar biasa."

#: ai/agents/ollama.py:25
msgid ""
"An open-source LLM engine that runs on the user's local PC, ensuring privacy"
" and functioning without an internet connection."
msgstr ""
"Mesin LLM open-source yang berjalan di PC lokal pengguna, menjaga privasi "
"dan berfungsi tanpa koneksi internet."

#: ai/agents/openai.py:23
msgid ""
"OpenAI's widely recognized GPT engine, featuring powerful logical reasoning "
"and creative writing capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Mesin GPT dari OpenAI yang dikenal luas, dengan kemampuan penalaran logis "
"yang kuat dan penulisan kreatif."

#: ai/agents/openai_compatible.py:43
msgid ""
"A generic driver for any provider that speaks the OpenAI Chat Completions "
"wire format but does not have a dedicated engine here yet. Use this to "
"connect a new provider without writing code."
msgstr ""
"Driver generik untuk penyedia mana pun yang menggunakan format wire OpenAI "
"Chat Completions tetapi belum memiliki mesin khusus di sini. Gunakan ini "
"untuk menghubungkan penyedia baru tanpa menulis kode."

