msgstr "AoT backup"

#: aot_flask/templates/tools/export.html:93
msgid "before importing settings data!"
msgstr "before importing settings data!"

#: aot_flask/templates/tools/export.html:94
msgid ""
"This feature allows you to replace current settings by uploading a ZIP file "
"containing the AoT setup database and custom "
"functions/inputs/outputs/widgets. You must only import databases that are of"
" the same or older version as the current AoT version. There is no procedure"
" to verify this, but problems may occur if a database version higher than "
"the current version is imported. Problems may also occur if the custom "
"controller is not compatible with the AoT version being imported."
msgstr ""
"This feature allows you to replace current settings by uploading a ZIP file "
"containing the AoT setup database and custom "
"functions/inputs/outputs/widgets. You must only import databases that are of"
" the same or older version as the current AoT version. There is no procedure"
" to verify this, but problems may occur if a database version higher than "
"the current version is imported. Problems may also occur if the custom "
"controller is not compatible with the AoT version being imported."

#: aot_flask/templates/tools/export.html:95
msgid ""
"Note 1: This feature overwrites all settings, user accounts, and custom "
"functions/inputs/outputs/widgets, and logs you out of the web UI. A backup "
"of the current database is created at "
"/opt/AoT/databases/aot.db.backup_DATE_TIME."
msgstr ""
"Note 1: This feature overwrites all settings, user accounts, and custom "
"functions/inputs/outputs/widgets, and logs you out of the web UI. A backup "
"of the current database is created at "
"/opt/AoT/databases/aot.db.backup_DATE_TIME."

#: aot_flask/templates/tools/export.html:96
msgid ""
"Note 2: During this process, the new database is upgraded to the current AoT"
" version, and all unmet dependencies are installed. If there are many "
"dependencies, this process may take some time to complete, so please be "
"patient."
msgstr ""
"Note 2: During this process, the new database is upgraded to the current AoT"
" version, and all unmet dependencies are installed. If there are many "
"dependencies, this process may take some time to complete, so please be "
"patient."

