#: inputs_gis/gis_bing.py:17
msgid ""
"Microsoft global map service providing high-resolution aerial imagery "
"(Aerial) and aerial with labels (Hybrid), with clean and precise road maps."
msgstr ""
"Layanan peta global Microsoft yang menyediakan citra udara resolusi tinggi "
"(Aerial) dan citra udara dengan label (Hybrid), dengan peta jalan yang "
"bersih dan presisi."

#: inputs_gis/gis_bing.py:39
msgid "Bing Maps API Key"
msgstr "API Key Bing Maps"

#: inputs_gis/gis_carto.py:16
msgid ""
"Data analysis-focused maps from CARTO DB. Offers restrained color schemes "
"with Positron (light), Dark Matter (dark), and Voyager styles, designed to "
"make data points and sensor information stand out."
msgstr ""
"Peta yang berfokus pada analisis data dari CARTO DB. Menawarkan skema warna "
"yang terkendali dengan gaya Positron (terang), Dark Matter (gelap), dan "
"Voyager, yang dirancang agar titik data dan informasi sensor lebih menonjol."

#: inputs_gis/gis_esa.py:9
msgid ""
"A global land cover map based on European Space Agency (ESA) Sentinel-2 "
"satellite data. Vegetation, urban areas, cropland, forest, and water bodies "
"are classified and color-coded at 10m resolution, useful for environmental "
"analysis."
msgstr ""

#: inputs_gis/gis_esri.py:7
msgid "Esri"
msgstr "Esri"

#: inputs_gis/gis_esri.py:8
msgid ""
"Authoritative map service from global GIS leader Esri. Provides crisp and "
"detailed World Imagery aerial satellite photos, optimized for accurate "
"terrain and facility visualization."
msgstr ""
"Layanan peta resmi dari Esri, pemimpin GIS global. Menyediakan foto satelit "
"udara World Imagery yang tajam dan detail, dioptimalkan untuk visualisasi "
"medan dan fasilitas yang akurat."

#: inputs_gis/gis_google.py:32
msgid ""
"Most widely used Google web map service. Supports Road, Satellite, Hybrid, "
"and Terrain modes based on vast geographic information. Terrain mode excels "
"at showing contours and hillshading. Also supports Geocoding API for "
"address-to-coordinate conversion. API key available from Google Developer "
"Console."
msgstr ""
"Layanan peta web Google yang paling banyak digunakan. Mendukung mode Jalan, "
"Satelit, Hybrid, dan Medan berdasarkan informasi geografis yang luas. Mode "
"Medan unggul dalam menampilkan kontur dan pembayangan bukit. Juga mendukung "
"Geocoding API untuk konversi alamat ke koordinat. API key tersedia dari "
"Google Developer Console."

#: inputs_gis/gis_gsi.py:16
msgid ""
"High-precision public map service from Japan Geospatial Information "
"Authority (GSI). Contains detailed terrain and place name information across"
" Japan, with professional layers including standard maps, pale maps, and "
"aerial photography."
msgstr ""
"Layanan peta publik presisi tinggi dari Badan Informasi Geospasial Jepang "
"(GSI). Berisi informasi medan dan nama tempat yang detail di seluruh Jepang,"
" dengan lapisan profesional termasuk peta standar, peta pucat, dan foto "
"udara."

#: inputs_gis/gis_image_overlay.py:28
msgid "AoT"
msgstr "AoT"

#: inputs_gis/gis_image_overlay.py:30
msgid ""
"Overlay a user-uploaded aerial or drone photo on the map. On upload, GPS and"
" camera pose embedded in the photo (EXIF/XMP) are used to place it "
"automatically; the four corners can then be dragged to fine-tune the fit "
"against map features."
msgstr ""
"Menampilkan overlay foto udara atau drone yang diunggah pengguna di atas "
"peta. Saat diunggah, data GPS dan orientasi kamera yang tertanam dalam foto "
"(EXIF/XMP) digunakan untuk menempatkannya secara otomatis; keempat sudutnya "
"kemudian dapat diseret untuk menyesuaikan posisinya terhadap fitur peta."

#: inputs_gis/gis_isric.py:8
msgid "pH (Water)"
msgstr "pH (Air)"

#: inputs_gis/gis_isric.py:19
msgid ""
"Global soil characteristic map from World Soil Information Service (ISRIC). "
"Visualizes soil composition (clay, sand, etc.), pH levels, and carbon "
"content for geological analysis as overlayer data."
msgstr ""
"Peta karakteristik tanah global dari World Soil Information Service (ISRIC)."
" Memvisualisasikan komposisi tanah (liat, pasir, dll.), tingkat pH, dan "
"kandungan karbon sebagai data overlay untuk analisis geologis."

